## Organization

## Data Models.R

The R file containing all code used to create and train the two models.

## Property_Damage_Model.RData

The R data file containing the model used to predict property damage given certain crash conditions.

## Bodily_Harm_Model.RData

The model used to identify how certain crash characteristics change the odds of bodily harm resulting from the crash can be found here: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1EWCUyCHuCtStLr9YJXomz6B_QxGFNVxs/view?usp=drive_link
